      Plump Mushroom carries Fungus, Banana and Starapple carry neither. So the five fruit and veg
      yields beside this one are right to carry nothing, and this one was wrong to. #860.

      Declared rather than inherited: this comes from Snack, so nothing reaches it from the plant.
